<summary>
<strong>Question: Getting an error while running <code>make server</code> on Windows?</strong>
</summary><strong>Answer:</strong> <p>On Windows, set up the project on Ubuntu WSL2 and you will be able to run the Meshery UI and the server. For more information please visit <a href="/v0.8/project/contributing/meshery-windows">Setting up Meshery Development Environment on Windows</a>.</p>
</details>

